<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>First Aid</h1>
<p>Skill
Class: Healer (guild level 0), Dark Knight, Paladin, Ranger (3, up to 50%), Druid (5, up to 80%), Thief (9, up to 30%)
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>aid &lt;character&gt;
</pre>
<p>Tends the wounds of someone who has fallen, bleeding and close to death: 
mortally wounded, incapacitated or stunned. Each time you succeed, you win 
them back a hit point, bringing them a step closer to waking up; keep at it 
until they are out of danger. It does nothing for someone who is merely 
hurt.
</p><p>Your skill decides it, with your brain and your divine power. If you fail, nothing changes; if you 
fumble badly, you poke in their wounds and make things worse.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Mortally Wounded</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Incapacitated</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Cure Light Wounds</a>
</pre>




</div>